#. type: Title #
#: docs/sap/tools.md:1 docs/sap/tools.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "SAP Tools"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/tools.md:8
msgid ""
"Satellites register **local tools** on the Hub. The agent invokes them "
"during a bound session; Hub forwards execution to the Satellite via "
"`tool.call` and waits for `tool.result` / `tool.error`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/tools.md:10
msgid ""
"Implementation: [`capabilities/satellite/src/manager.ts`](../../capabilities/"
"satellite/src/manager.ts)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/tools.md:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Naming"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/tools.md:14
msgid ""
"Canonical name format ([`packages/sap-contract/src/naming.ts`](../../"
"packages/sap-contract/src/naming.ts)):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/sap/tools.md:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "sap_{app_slug}_{instance_id_norm}_{local_name}\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/tools.md:20
msgid "Alias (also accepted):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/sap/tools.md:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "sap:{app_slug}:{instance_id_norm}:{local_name}\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/tools.md:28
msgid "`app_slug` — lowercased app id without `-` / `_`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/tools.md:28
msgid "`instance_id_norm` — lowercased instance id without `-`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/tools.md:28
msgid "`local_name` — tool name as registered by the Satellite"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/tools.md:30
msgid ""
"Example: `sap_pairprogramming_a1b2c3d4e5f6789012345678abcdef01_scan_code`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/tools.md:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registration flow"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (mermaid)
#: docs/sap/tools.md:33
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sequenceDiagram\n"
"  participant Sat as Satellite\n"
"  participant Hub as Hub\n"
"  participant Agent as AgentRuntime\n"
"\n"
"  Sat->>Hub: req tool.register tools local_name description parameters\n"
"  Hub->>Hub: SatelliteManager.registerTools\n"
"  Hub->>Sat: res registered canonical names\n"
"  Note over Agent: later during message.send stream\n"
"  Agent->>Hub: invoke sap_* tool\n"
"  Hub->>Sat: evt tool.call call_id local_name args\n"
"  Sat->>Sat: execute local handler\n"
"  Sat->>Hub: req tool.result call_id content\n"
"  Hub->>Agent: resume turn\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/tools.md:51
msgid ""
"Register via `tool.register` with `SapToolDefInput`: `local_name`, "
"`description`, `parameters` (JSON Schema object), optional `return_kind` "
"(`json` | `text`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/tools.md:53
msgid "On disconnect, Hub unregisters all tools for that app/instance."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/tools.md:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "Strict routing"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/tools.md:57
msgid ""
"SAP-prefixed tool names **never fall back** to Hub-local tools with the same "
"name. `SatelliteManager.installToolRouting()` wraps "
"`ToolSetRegistry.getTool` to enforce this."
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (mermaid)
#: docs/sap/tools.md:58
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"flowchart TD\n"
"  Invoke[Agent invokes sap_* tool]\n"
"  Parse[parseSapToolName]\n"
"  BindCheck{Session platform_extra matches app and instance?}\n"
"  Online{Instance connected?}\n"
"  Registered{Tool in toolIndex?}\n"
"  Proxy[Forward tool.call to Satellite]\n"
"  Reject[toolError with reason]\n"
"\n"
"  Invoke --> Parse\n"
"  Parse --> BindCheck\n"
"  BindCheck -->|no| Reject\n"
"  BindCheck -->|yes| Online\n"
"  Online -->|no| Reject\n"
"  Online -->|yes| Registered\n"
"  Registered -->|no| Reject\n"
"  Registered -->|yes| Proxy\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/tools.md:79
msgid "Common rejection reasons:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/tools.md:86
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Condition                                   | Result                                        |\n"
"| ------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Session not bound to satellite app/instance | Reject                                        |\n"
"| Instance offline                            | Reject                                        |\n"
"| Tool not registered on connected instance   | Reject                                        |\n"
"| Unregistered `sap_*` name                   | Guard handler returns error (no Hub fallback) |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/tools.md:88
msgid ""
"Session binding requires `platform_extra.satellite_app_id` and "
"`platform_extra.satellite_instance_id` set at `session.create` time."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/tools.md:90
msgid ""
"Integration tests: [`tests/integration/sap/sap-routing.test.ts`](../../tests/"
"integration/sap/sap-routing.test.ts)."
msgstr ""

